    "enUS": {
      "description": "What?\n\nWhat?!\n\nYou want money? I don't owe you any money.\n\nLetter? What letter? Oh, you wanna fight then? All right, mate... let's do this! Owe you any money...",
      "dialogue": {
        "5b80214373cfbf9e4a4a": "What?$B$BWhat?!$B$BYou want money? I don't owe you any money.$B$BLetter? What letter? Oh, you wanna fight then? All right, mate... let's do this! Owe you any money...",
        "d0711110a7bbdc0024c3": "Incredible! What skill!$B$BThought you'd be easy prey, $N. Got me good, you did.$B$BHere's the coin I promised... not as much as I said it'd be, but that's on a count o' me lying to ya in the first place."
      },
